<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Malayawata 6-mth net up 39 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Malayawata 6-mth net up 39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit	   20.70	  vs	    14.90</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)  15.40	  vs	    11.08</p>
<p>    Turnover	    272.57	  vs	   211.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     20.70	  vs	    14.82</p>
<p>Note: Full name of the company is Malayawata Steel Bhd. It is engaged in the operation of an integrated steel mill.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
